  "title": "A venue corpus's papers.json",
  "description": "The record of a venue corpus, papers.json: one row per paper, every copy with its licence. This schema lists the fields; it cannot express that a key is unique, that a paper's edition is one of editions[].edition, or that a copy that stores a file names where it was fetched from. `node ${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}/scripts/corpus-licences.js <venue>` checks those and refuses a wrong record with the path of the field."
